{"result":"{
  "id": "18201",
  "key": "SFCC-118",
  "summary": "Recommendations – Recommended for You Carousel UI",
  "description": "**As a** Shopper, \n\n**I want** a \"Recommended for You\" carousel displayed across relevant pages of the site, \n\n**so that** I can discover products tailored to my browsing and purchase history.\n\n----\n\nThis story covers the PWA build of the Recommended for You carousel component, powered by Einstein Product Recommendations with rules-based fallback. The carousel appears across the following surfaces, all labelled \"Recommended for You\": PDP, Cart page (both when the bag contains items and when it is empty), and Search results page. Recommendations are driven by behavioural and purchase history data for logged-in shoppers, falling back to session-based browsing history for guests. The carousel component can be built and unit tested independently; integration testing on each surface is dependent on Squad A delivering the host pages — PDP: SFCC-5, Cart: SFCC-11, Search: SFCC-114. Depends on SFCC-112 (Recommendations – Einstein Configuration & Zone Setup).\n\n**Reference Image (Figma is leading):**\n\n![\"image-20260803-231622.png\"](image-20260803-231622.png)",
